% Without a prefacing |\set|\-|caption|\-|sub|\-|type|, |\sub|\-|caption| is some kind
% of |\caption|\-|of{sub|\-|\@cap|\-|type}|.
% \Note{Like \cs{captionof}, this command is designed to be used inside an
